  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together brown sugar, soy sauce, rice vinegar, garlic, ginger, red pepper flakes, and black pepper.",
    "Add the pork belly cubes to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
    "Let the pork belly marinate for at least 30 minutes, or up to 2 hours in the refrigerator.",
    "Thread the marinated pork belly cubes onto the bamboo skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until the pork is cooked through and slightly charred.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
